  </knowledge>

  <steps>
    <step order="1">Read `sprk_communication_send.js` (send payload/flow) + `CommunicationEndpoints.cs` (send) + `EmailArchiver.cs` (archival) + `SendEmailPage.tsx` (composer host) to confirm the reuse contracts.</step>
    <step order="2">Add the thin `POST /api/communications/{id}/archive` endpoint invoking the existing `EmailArchiver` (on-demand .eml + per-attachment Document archival); ProblemDetails errors (ADR-019); add BFF tests; §10 obligations (placement justification, publish-size, CVE).</step>
    <step order="3">Scaffold the Actions PCF (`src/client/pcf/CommunicationActions/`): manifest bound to `sprk_communication` form; platform-library React/Fluent; React root.</step>
    <step order="4">Render the action bar (Reply / Forward / Send / Save Draft / Save to SharePoint), status-aware (compose vs sent). Wire Send → `/api/communications/send`; Save Draft → `communicationApi` draft + Xrm save; Save to SharePoint → new `/{id}/archive`.</step>
    <step order="5">Host `<SendEmailPage/>` (or its dialog) for compose/reply/forward; wire mode + pre-fill from the record (reply/forward), `authenticatedFetch` from host, onSent → refresh/navigate.</step>
    <step order="6">Verify the PCF Send is equivalent to the ribbon script; then RETIRE `sprk_communication_send.js` (both copies) + the ribbon button definition. Record the ribbon-audit + equivalence in task notes (closes task 062).</step>
    <step order="7">`npm run build:prod` the PCF (clean) + `dotnet build`/`dotnet test` for the `/archive` endpoint.</step>
    <step order="7.1">Publish-size delta (baseline ~45.28 MB incl PDBs) + CVE for the `/archive` addition.</step>
    <step order="9.5">FULL-rigor gates: `code-review` + `adr-check` (ADR-022/028/012/019 + §10 for the endpoint). Address Critical findings.</step>
    <step order="10">`/conflict-check` (BFF hot-path for the endpoint). Update `tasks/TASK-INDEX.md` (044 ✅; 062 folded/closed) + `current-task.md`.</step>
  </steps>

  <tools>
    <tool name="read">Ribbon send script, send endpoint, archiver, composer host</tool>
    <tool name="edit">/archive endpoint; scaffold + wire Actions PCF; retire ribbon script</tool>
    <tool name="bash">PCF prod build; dotnet build/test; publish-size; CVE</tool>
    <tool name="code-review">FULL-rigor gate</tool>
    <tool name="adr-check">FULL-rigor gate</tool>
    <tool name="conflict-check">Pre-PR hot-path (endpoint)</tool>
  </tools>

  <outputs>
